<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n58097" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κμητός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>wrought</i>, <i><span class="en">Hsch.,
					<u>EM</u>521.31</span></i>:—found
			only in compds. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κνᾰδάλλω</span></b> , 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κνάω</span>
			, <i>scratch</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κνάζει:</span></b> 
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βοηθεῖ</span>, Id. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κναίω</span></b> , 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κνάω</span>
			, prob.l. for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καινιεῖ</span>, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Si.</u>
				38.28
			</span></i>:— elsewh. only in compds. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κνᾱκίας</span></b> , <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κνᾱκός</span></b> , <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κνάκων</span></b> , 
				Dor.
			 for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κνηκ</span>-. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κνᾶμις</span></b> , 
				v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κνημίς</span>
			. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κνάμπτω</span></b> , 
				v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κνάπτω</span>
			. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κνάξ:</span></b> 
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γάλα λευκόν</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>; cf. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κναξζβί</span></b> 
				(cj.<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κνάξ</span>) <i><span class="en">
				Thespis
				4
			</span></i>.</div>
